OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CDeal with EU not dependent on tuition  
OL,5,Cfees agreement, Miliband says          
OL,6,GA deal agreed between the UK and the   
OL,7,GEuropean Union on Friday will come     
OL,8,Ginto force regardless of whether the   
OL,9,Gtwo sides can negotiate a separate     
OL,10,Gtuition fees agreement, Foreign        
OL,11,GSecretary Ed Miliband has told the BBC.
OL,13,FThe measures agreed in Brussels        
OL,14,Finclude scrapping most checks on       
OL,15,FBritish food exports in return for the 
OL,16,FUK following some EU regulations from  
OL,17,F2028, and a new youth mobility scheme. 
OL,19,FHowever, a proposal from the bloc to   
OL,20,Flower the level of tuition fees paid   
OL,21,Fby EU students in the UK has not been  
OL,22,Fagreed.                           G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
