OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CScouts say they face #1m tourist tax   
OL,5,Ccost for overnight trips               
OL,6,GScout groups are warning they could    
OL,7,Gface an additional annual bill of #1m  
OL,8,Gas a result of the government's        
OL,9,Gproposed tourist tax for England.      
OL,11,FThe overnight levy would allow         
OL,12,Fcouncils and regional authorities to   
OL,13,Fcharge visitors an additional fee for  
OL,14,Ftheir accommodation, including         
OL,15,Fcampsites, raising money to be spent   
OL,16,Fon local services.                     
OL,18,FThe increased cost from the Visitors   
OL,19,FLevy could price some young people out 
OL,20,Fof joining Scout camps and other       
OL,21,Ftrips, the group said.                 
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
